Diagnostic facts retained:
- legacy-v1 was identified from the actual MMIO version register; QueueNotify trace reached QEMU before GuestPageSize was fixed, with no virtio_blk_handle_read.
- The driver now writes GuestPageSize=4096, QueueAlign=4096 and QueuePFN for legacy v1. Modern v2 uses QueueDesc=0x080, QueueAvail=0x090, QueueUsed=0x0a0 and VERSION_1 negotiation.
- Invalid fence spelling and intermediate build failures were fixed rather than removing the build checks.

